<http://www.mimo-db.eu/InstrumentsKeywords/7028> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> """Idioglot transverse clarinet of the Bissa people in Burkina Faso. Made from a hollowed-out millet stalk. It has two small gourd resonators with side windows placed over the
